            "review_title": "Review at Hải sản Pocha - Pocha Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Dave M\nSan Phak Wan, Thailand274 contributions\n0\nGreat Asian Seafood in French Quarter Hanoi\nMar 2024 • Couples\nGreat seafood restaurant, we had seafood fried rice, seafood noodles, morning glory and. Two types of clams three beers and a coke. Too much food for $17.50 including the tip. Food and service were terrific, the down side is no English is spoken, but with Google Translate we made it. If you like Asian prepared seafood a must stop.\nWritten March 13, 2024",
